# Attendee Bot — ElevenLabs STT Transcription
# See attendee/README.md for full setup instructions

# ElevenLabs API key is configured via the Attendee web UI
# (Settings -> Credentials -> ElevenLabs) after services are running.
# It's stored encrypted in the database, not here.

# The attendee/.env file contains:
# - CREDENTIALS_ENCRYPTION_KEY (auto-generated)
# - DJANGO_SECRET_KEY (auto-generated)
# - DJANGO_SETTINGS_MODULE=attendee.settings.development
# - POSTGRES_HOST=postgres
# - REDIS_URL=redis://redis:6379/5
